# Vitest and Nuxt testing (repo-specific)

Official reference: [Nuxt 4 — Testing](https://nuxt.com/docs/4.x/getting-started/testing).

## Commands and config files

- **`pnpm test`** (from repo root) delegates to the app package and uses **`app/vitest.config.ts`** (`TZ=UTC vitest --run --config vitest.config.ts` inside `app/`).
- **`pnpm test:crypto`** delegates to **`app/vitest.crypto.config.ts`**: Hash/Rsa service tests listed in **`vitestSlowTestExcludes`** (slow bcrypt work; not part of default `pnpm test`). **`JwtService.test.ts`** runs with **`pnpm test`**.
- **`app/vitest.config.all.ts`** only re-exports `app/vitest.config.ts` for backwards compatibility; prefer **`app/vitest.config.ts`** for new references.
- Coverage config lives at **`app/vitest.config.coverage.ts`** (same project split + coverage reporters/options).

## Vitest projects (required pattern here)

Do **not** set global `test.environment: 'nuxt'` for the entire suite (slow; hybrid-env pitfalls per Nuxt docs).

- **`node`** project: `environment: 'node'`. Include/exclude globs: **`app/vitest.test-globs.ts`** (`vitestNodeTestIncludes`, `vitestNodeProjectExcludes`). The node project **excludes** `tests/nuxt/**` and `**/*.nuxt.{test,spec}.ts` so those files run only under the Nuxt project.
- **`nuxt`** project: built with **`defineVitestProject`** from `@nuxt/test-utils/config`. Includes **`app/tests/nuxt/**/*.test.ts`** and **`**/*.nuxt.{test,spec}.ts`** — use for composables/pages/plugins that need **`useNuxtApp`**, auto-imports, or full Nuxt pipeline.

## `~/` resolution in Vitest

Aliases are centralized in **`app/vitest.resolve-aliases.ts`** (`vitestResolveAliases`, **`vitestAliasLayer`**). Each Vitest subproject merges **`vitestAliasLayer`** via **`mergeConfig` from `vite`** — root-level `resolve.alias` alone is **not** reliably applied to multi-project runs.

## Nuxt app (`app/nuxt.config.ts`)

- **`@nuxt/test-utils/module`** is registered in **`modules`** (DevTools Vitest integration when DevTools are enabled).
- **`typescript.tsConfig.include`** includes paths for **`app/tests/nuxt`** (relative to generated `.nuxt/tsconfig.json`, per Nuxt docs) so TS/editor resolve Nuxt test dirs.

## Package versions

- **`@nuxt/test-utils` v4.x** peers **`vitest ^4`** and aligns with **Nuxt 4.5 / Vite 8**. Pool options are top-level (`maxWorkers`, `isolate`); do not use removed `test.poolOptions`.

## Class / constructor mocks (Vitest 4)

Mocks called with `new` must use `function`/`class` `mockImplementation` (or [`app/tests/helpers/mockConstructable.ts`](app/tests/helpers/mockConstructable.ts)), never arrow functions — arrows throw `is not a constructor`.

## Agent policy

Test add/run policy lives in **`05-workflow-execution.mdc`** (do not add, modify, or run tests unless the user asks).
